WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:07.980
We often use the term 'reporter' to
describe the function of GFP. What it's

2
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:13.710
reporting is some activity within the
cell, usually the production of a

3
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:20.530
protein, or a position of a protein, or
the position of a organelle, like the

4
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:27.170
nucleus or the Golgi apparatus, or
synaptic vesicles, or sometimes just

5
00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:33.950
reporting about the cell. So anything
that we can get some input from can be

6
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:41.200
used as a reporter. So people have used
in the past other fluorescent molecules,

7
00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:46.910
not proteins, as a way of showing where
something is in the cell. So a reporter

8
00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:51.820
is nothing more than something that
shows where something of interest

9
00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:52.800
actually is.

